_HEY72Q1PC74CX7Y201M1CRN7JS","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.905Z","goal_id":"goal_8BPK84CJC8RV9ZSF01M1CRN7JX","relation":"supports","source_id":"rsrc_ANX45MXF9Z6WBTMA01M1CRN7JQ"},{"claim_id":"rclm_HEY72Q1PC74CX7Y201M1CRN7JS","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.904Z","goal_id":"goal_8BPK84CJC8RV9ZSF01M1CRN7JX","relation":"supports","source_id":"rsrc_XWJ29WAF67G8W5PQ01M1CRN7JK"},{"claim_id":"rclm_M7D7C8YTCP345C2201M1CRN7JS","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.904Z","goal_id":"goal_8BPK84CJC8RV9ZSF01M1CRN7JX","relation":"supports","source_id":"rsrc_QTA2K5RQ5DJQEEW501M1CRN7JK"},{"claim_id":"rclm_M7D7C8YTCP345C2201M1CRN7JS","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.904Z","goal_id":"goal_8BPK84CJC8RV9ZSF01M1CRN7JX","relation":"supports","source_id":"rsrc_RPGX144DW04KY6J901M1CRN7JS"},{"claim_id":"rclm_M7D7C8YTCP345C2201M1CRN7JS","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.904Z","goal_id":"goal_8BPK84CJC8RV9ZSF01M1CRN7JX","relation":"supports","source_id":"rsrc_XWJ29WAF67G8W5PQ01M1CRN7JK"},{"claim_id":"rclm_ZTPJ0HQHVR1WWHHY01M1CRN7JS","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.904Z","goal_id":"goal_8BPK84CJC8RV9ZSF01M1CRN7JX","relation":"supports","source_id":"rsrc_2G4QHH1244YN0MAY01M1CRN7JM"},{"claim_id":"rclm_ZTPJ0HQHVR1WWHHY01M1CRN7JS","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.904Z","goal_id":"goal_8BPK84CJC8RV9ZSF01M1CRN7JX","relation":"supports","source_id":"rsrc_SCVHC8B4QJ0KYBH201M1CRN7JR"},{"claim_id":"rclm_ZTPJ0HQHVR1WWHHY01M1CRN7JS","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.904Z","goal_id":"goal_8BPK84CJC8RV9ZSF01M1CRN7JX","relation":"supports","source_id":"rsrc_XWJ29WAF67G8W5PQ01M1CRN7JK"}],"claims":[{"campaign_id":"rcamp_9F570GCAJDQAXJNP01M1CRN7JX","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.903Z","goal_id":"goal_8BPK84CJC8RV9ZSF01M1CRN7JX","id":"rclm_2HN243QZZT5BP9XC01M1CRN7JS","text":"Overhead accounting in the local model: per-scope projection carries a modeled fixed per-index overhead (3 x 256 bytes) versus one shared index (256 bytes) - measured 1388B vs 876B - while aggregate paths scan only the authorized scope's rows for per-scope (51 row-scans) versus the full shared index with per-row predicates for shared-RLS (105 row-scans). Both effects are small at MVP scale; the overhead constant is a declared model assumption."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_9F570GCAJDQAXJNP01M1CRN7JX","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.902Z","goal_id":"goal_8BPK84CJC8RV9ZSF01M1CRN7JX","id":"rclm_7JDFJ8AHGBF7ZZ8W01M1CRN7JS","text":"The bounded local existence-oracle timing probe (frozen methodology: 200 samples x 8 inner repeats x 3 seeds per arm, median-of-seed-medians, tolerance max(10%, 1us)) shows no signal above the frozen tolerance for either honest variant (per_scope signal 6ns vs tolerance 2000ns; shared_rls signal 150ns vs tolerance 2000ns). This is a bounded local measurement, not a production SLO and not proof of absence of all side channels."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_9F570GCAJDQAXJNP01M1CRN7JX","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.902Z","goal_id":"goal_8BPK84CJC8RV9ZSF01M1CRN7JX","id":"rclm_8YQQGWQW882E76NH01M1CRN7JS","text":"Adversarial probe candidates are detected fail-closed through the evaluator's own ISO rules on real runner paths: A existence-oracle detail leak -> ISO2 FAIL; B stale shared-cache disclosure after revoke -> ISO3+ISO4 FAIL; C pre-policy aggregate count/rank/snippet leak -> ISO2 FAIL; D forged-scope acceptance -> ISO7 FAIL plus provenance-dropping projection -> ISO5 INCOMPARABLE."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_9F570GCAJDQAXJNP01M1CRN7JX","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.901Z","goal_id":"goal_8BPK84CJC8RV9ZSF01M1CRN7JX","id":"rclm_APEHC2CZG861Z41701M1CRN7JS","text":"Dependency gate: S1-003 (revision 24, pass) and S1-005 (revision 7, pass_with_limits) verified from actual bytes: tracked content-addressed evidence packs, file/payload SHA-256, canonical DB evaluation ids, artifact chain hashes and docs status all agree."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_9F570GCAJDQAXJNP01M1CRN7JX","claim_class":"inference","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.903Z","goal_id":"goal_8BPK84CJC8RV9ZSF01M1CRN7JX","id":"rclm_HEY72Q1PC74CX7Y201M1CRN7JS","text":"Adopted policy: per-scope index projections bound to the canonical (tenant, workspace, goal) scope with the frozen cache/invalidation semantics; rollback path is symmetric (rebuild from the canonical object store, which remains the single source of truth); measurable migration trigger away from per-scope projections: a documented need for cross-scope ranked federation inside one trust boundary PLUS measured evidence that per-scope projection maintenance (index count growth, reindex cost) exceeds a shared predicate layer at equal ISO1-ISO8 compliance - the trigger requires new evidence, not opinion.  The <=5s revocation SLO stays S1-008; profile-C MLS/TEE stays S1-018."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_9F570GCAJDQAXJNP01M1CRN7JX","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.902Z","goal_id":"goal_8BPK84CJC8RV9ZSF01M1CRN7JX","id":"rclm_M7D7C8YTCP345C2201M1CRN7JS","text":"Under the frozen isolation contract both honest variants hold ISO1-ISO8 with zero violations across the accepted fixture set (2 variants x 14 cases x 3 seeds x 2 executors = 168 runs; ISO counters main/rerun: per_scope {\"ISO1\": 0, \"ISO2\": 0, \"ISO3\": 0, \"ISO4\": 0, \"ISO5\": 0, \"ISO6\": 0, \"ISO7\": 0, \"ISO8\": 0} / {\"ISO1\": 0, \"ISO2\": 0, \"ISO3\": 0, \"ISO4\": 0, \"ISO5\": 0, \"ISO6\": 0, \"ISO7\": 0, \"ISO8\": 0}, shared_rls {\"ISO1\": 0, \"ISO2\": 0, \"ISO3\": 0, \"ISO4\": 0, \"ISO5\": 0, \"ISO6\": 0, \"ISO7\": 0, \"ISO8\": 0} / {\"ISO1\": 0, \"ISO2\": 0, \"ISO3\": 0, \"ISO4\": 0, \"ISO5\": 0, \"ISO6\": 0, \"ISO7\": 0, \"ISO8\": 0}); deny bodies are byte-identical across foreign/nonexistent/forged/malformed/unknown equivalence classes and provenance plus canonical scope binding survive projection and retrieval on every disclosed object."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_9F570GCAJDQAXJNP01M1CRN7JX","claim_class":"inference","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.903Z","goal_id":"goal_8BPK84CJC8RV9ZSF01M1CRN7JX","id":"rclm_ZTPJ0HQHVR1WWHHY01M1CRN7JS","text":"QA3 decision: per_scope wins under the frozen rubric (per_scope 3.7183 vs shared_rls 3.5483); sensitivity across 212 weight perturbations (11 one-at-a-time +-50% renormalized + 200 seeded random vectors) shows 0 winner flips.  Deciding evidence beyond identical hard-invariant compliance: shared-index single-fault blast radius (predicate bypass affects 2 scopes vs 1 for a misfiled per-scope projection), profile-C compatibility (server-side shared index is incompatible with the documented E2EE client-index boundary), and migration cost from the current per-goal scoped gateway (0 rebuild steps for per-scope projections vs 2 for a shared predicate layer)."}],"current_chain_hash":"5e2b79ff3a2472eb358ae67263bb2074e31e2b12f7042a034a861474bc93d374","evaluations":[{"artifact_chain_hash":"5e2b79ff3a2472eb358ae67263bb2074e31e2b12f7042a034a861474bc93d374","campaign_id":"rcamp_9F570GCAJDQAXJNP01M1CRN7JX","created_at":"2026-08-31T20:37:31.941Z","details":{"audit":{"auditor":"agentos-s1-007-independent-verifier","limitations":["All measurements come from a deterministic stdlib-only local simulation; no production search service, latency or privacy certification is claimed.","The timing probe is a bounded same-host wall-clock measurement of a microsecond-scale in-process path; it cannot prove absence of all side channels and is never a production SLO.","D9/D11 are inference-type cells derived from the frozen contract, the current implementation and the documented profiles; a profile-C MLS/TEE contract remains S1-018 scope."],"producer":"agentos-s1-007-producer","subject_producer":"agentos-s1-007-producer","verdict":"pass_with_limits"},"config":{"min_source_count":3,"min_verified_ratio":1.0,"required_artifacts":["research_plan","source_registry","feature_catalog","architecture_models","mental_model","ontology","mathematical_model","synthesis_and_gaps","independent_audit","platform_plan","progress"]},"next_